OL,6,G0300 Julia Bradbury's Wonders of the
OL,7,G     Frozen South
OL,8,     FJulia Bradbury journeys to the
OL,9,     Fedge of the world to experience
OL,10,     Fthe beauty and brutal conditions
OL,11,     Fof Antarctica as she explores its
OL,12,     Ficy landscapes and extraordinary
OL,13,     Fwildlife. After crossing the
OL,14,     FSouthern Ocean, Julia's boat is
OL,15,     Fsurrounded by penguins and seals
OL,16,     Fbefore a pod of humpback whales
OL,17,     Ffinally breaks cover to breath and
OL,18,     Ffeed. Following an emotional
OL,19,     Fovernight camp in Paradise Bay,
OL,20,     FJulia then experiences the raw
OL,21,     Fpower of nature thanks to a giant
OL,22,     Ficeberg split
